abstract: >-
  BSSUnfoldR is an R port of the Python package 'bssunfold' (Radiationsafety/
  bssunfold) for unfolding neutron spectra measured with Bonner Sphere
  Spectrometers. It provides a Detector R6 class with 60+ unfolding
  algorithms (iterative, Bayesian, maximum-entropy, Krylov/regularization,
  statistical regularization, sparse/dictionary, optimization/meta-heuristic,
  parametric and pipeline/ensemble families), Monte-Carlo uncertainty
  estimation, a max_neutron_energy cutoff on every method, comparisons and
  benchmarking utilities, ggplot2 visualisation, and dose-rate calculation
  using ICRP-74, ICRP-116 and NRB99-2009 conversion coefficients plus seven
  published Bonner-sphere response functions (GSF, PTB, LANL, JINR, FERMILAB,
  EURADOS, IHEP).
